  "usage": [
    "Use 白色 to talk about the colour white. Example:  呢件衫係白色。",
    "It often comes before a noun to describe something’s colour. Example:  白色鞋好襯。",
    "You can use it in everyday conversation for clothes, objects, and animals. Example:  我鍾意白色杯。",
    "It can also be used in fixed colour expressions. Example:  白色牆身睇落好光。"
